note_tweet.text:
BREAKING: Polygon Labs is now a U.S.-regulated payments business.

The Coinme acquisition is complete. It brings regulated U.S. money movement into Polygon Open Money Stack.

@Tazapay, @meshpay, @useToku, and Kira join as the first set of businesses moving money with the unified stack.

